/global.ts on the dev branch: xdgData and xdgConfig joined with \"opencode\") and its own uninstall command (packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/uninstall.ts: --keep-data and --keep-config keep exactly these two; its cache and state folders are always removed, so they are not listed here). See families.rs.",
